BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.6929 291.4016 Tm (print needs a stiffer plate still. A warped board produces a calibration that looks fine and is WRONG: the solver assumes a) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.6929 279.2126 Tm (plane, the bow can be absorbed into the lens model at a small reprojection error, and every measurement inherits it.) Tj ET
